WEBVTT

00:47.100 --> 00:48.420
Zhang Haiqi!

00:49.740 --> 00:51.150
You can't escape!

03:28.260 --> 03:34.300
[Archives: The Nanyang Mystery]

03:34.760 --> 03:37.240
[Episode 15]

03:50.110 --> 03:50.370
[Southern Archives]

03:50.960 --> 03:52.910
These are the secret symbols used

03:52.910 --> 03:54.120
by Archives agents during collaborations.

03:54.120 --> 03:56.400
Different symbols mean different things.

03:56.400 --> 03:58.060
Memorize them before sunset.

04:17.730 --> 04:19.399
[To warn one not to enter what's ahead;
there's danger.]

04:19.420 --> 04:20.660
[Wealth] [Material success] [Begin]

04:20.680 --> 04:21.790
[Power] [Health] [Courage]

04:37.420 --> 04:39.350
What's the point of learning this?

04:40.170 --> 04:41.700
Isn't being strong enough?

04:42.320 --> 04:44.380
I'd rather spend this time training.

04:48.080 --> 04:48.920
What?

04:49.840 --> 04:52.440
But you must remember
at least this one symbol.

04:57.170 --> 04:58.970
This symbol represents danger.

04:59.540 --> 05:01.920
It represents the highest level
of danger in the Archives.

05:01.920 --> 05:03.060
If you ever, in future missions,

05:03.060 --> 05:03.920
encounter this symbol,

05:03.920 --> 05:04.510
leave immediately—

05:04.510 --> 05:05.440
don't hesitate.

05:06.060 --> 05:07.170
Because it means

05:11.090 --> 05:13.420
no agent can ever return from there alive.

06:22.010 --> 06:24.600
District 13
of Xiacheng Underground Waters.

06:24.940 --> 06:28.120
Southeast entrance
of the unknown ancient ruins.

06:28.150 --> 06:29.280
Third exploration.

06:29.760 --> 06:32.560
Mission objective:
collect antidote materials.

06:33.070 --> 06:34.540
Five explorers in total.

06:34.540 --> 06:35.620
Dived 15 zhang,

06:35.620 --> 06:36.550
about 50 meters.

06:36.750 --> 06:38.450
Zhang Nanshan, Zhang Dahai.

06:42.730 --> 06:47.350
[Fireworks; Fireworks;
There are fireworks below.]

06:43.470 --> 06:45.440
There are fireworks below.

06:49.659 --> 06:50.450
Fireworks?

06:55.810 --> 06:58.580
[20 minutes left to save Shrimpie]

10:18.700 --> 10:19.840
Shrimpie...

10:20.620 --> 10:21.630
Wait for me.

10:22.750 --> 10:24.610
I will definitely save your life.

10:25.560 --> 10:26.180
Shrimpie.

10:28.670 --> 10:29.690
Wait for me.

10:31.100 --> 10:31.980
Shrimpie.

10:56.270 --> 10:57.980
Now you know.

10:58.330 --> 11:00.140
You are just a mortal.

11:00.770 --> 11:02.830
Yet you really thought you were a god.

12:04.030 --> 12:06.750
Zhang Haiqi.

12:23.080 --> 12:25.010
What is your plan with Mo Yungao?

12:39.000 --> 12:41.530
Zhang Haiqi...

12:43.350 --> 12:45.660
The file the Commander wants

12:45.680 --> 12:48.550
is in the deepest part.

13:52.210 --> 13:55.110
Fireworks. There are fireworks below.

13:53.010 --> 13:54.860
[Fireworks; Fireworks;
There are fireworks below.]

16:02.420 --> 16:03.750
I gave you some life-saving medicine.

16:03.750 --> 16:05.280
You won't die anytime soon.

16:10.670 --> 16:11.520
Where are we?

16:11.850 --> 16:12.930
The outer passage.

16:13.170 --> 16:14.170
It's safe for now.

16:16.460 --> 16:17.550
How did you get in?

16:17.550 --> 16:20.350
The Archives has
a self-destruct defense system.

16:20.770 --> 16:22.500
If someone enters the Archives

16:22.940 --> 16:25.740
and opens the Broken Dragon Stone
from the inside,

16:27.120 --> 16:28.850
the underground will connect,

16:29.500 --> 16:31.100
and seawater will immediately pour in,

16:31.100 --> 16:32.830
flooding the entire Archives.

16:33.150 --> 16:35.150
Ordinary people wouldn't survive,

16:35.570 --> 16:37.120
but I can dive over.

16:43.100 --> 16:44.240
In a little while,

16:44.940 --> 16:47.000
the entire Archives will be flooded.

16:47.490 --> 16:49.420
Then, after getting the medicine,

16:50.500 --> 16:51.410
we can swim out.

16:54.120 --> 16:55.840
Are you pretending not to understand

16:55.840 --> 16:57.270
or not to hear me?

16:57.870 --> 16:59.170
I said you failed.

16:59.170 --> 17:00.290
You can't get that thing,

17:00.290 --> 17:02.090
and you can't save Zhang Haixia.

17:02.740 --> 17:04.000
When he was alive,

17:04.000 --> 17:05.930
you didn't change your bad habits.

17:06.170 --> 17:07.220
Now you regret it.

17:07.730 --> 17:09.859
Who are you throwing this tantrum for?

17:19.349 --> 17:21.079
Then just let me die here.

17:27.730 --> 17:29.080
There is one last way.

17:43.640 --> 17:44.370
Come with me.

17:50.400 --> 17:52.420
It will be another 6 hours
before the tide ebbs.

17:52.420 --> 17:54.310
Those jellyfish will recede with the tide

17:54.310 --> 17:55.640
and leave that sea area.

17:55.880 --> 17:58.160
As long as we go down again
before the tide ebbs,

17:58.160 --> 17:59.490
there's still a chance.

17:59.680 --> 18:00.940
Where are we going now?

18:01.580 --> 18:03.440
I'll show you the truth
about the Southern Archives.

18:03.440 --> 18:05.500
Aren't we supposed to save Shrimpie?

18:05.550 --> 18:06.810
If you want to save him,

18:06.960 --> 18:09.550
you must first understand
the truth of the Archives.

18:09.550 --> 18:11.830
Those things
are not so pleasant to look at.

18:11.830 --> 18:13.090
As a normal person,

18:13.350 --> 18:15.260
it will be hard to understand
after seeing them,

18:15.260 --> 18:16.920
and you might even break down.

18:17.680 --> 18:18.940
I think I can handle it.

18:20.600 --> 18:22.200
I know what you're thinking.

18:23.660 --> 18:24.380
A normal person

18:24.380 --> 18:26.240
who has done some extraordinary things

18:26.240 --> 18:28.500
always thinks they are no longer mortal.

18:28.620 --> 18:30.280
Over this long period of time,

18:30.460 --> 18:31.990
I have seen too many of them.

18:45.740 --> 18:46.920
This is not human skin, is it?

18:46.920 --> 18:47.770
Of course not.

18:48.440 --> 18:50.350
These are all made of animal skin

18:50.590 --> 18:52.920
to record the ancient tattoos
of a family.

18:52.960 --> 18:53.720
The Zhang family.

18:53.720 --> 18:54.720
The Zhang family?

18:55.100 --> 18:57.600
Yes. To understand
the origin of the Archives,

18:57.600 --> 18:59.600
we must start with the Zhang family.

18:59.750 --> 19:00.550
In the north of our country,

19:00.550 --> 19:01.880
there was a Zhang family

19:01.140 --> 19:04.420
[Zhang]

19:02.140 --> 19:03.720
who lived deep in the mountains

19:03.720 --> 19:05.500
and did a special kind of business.

19:05.500 --> 19:07.700
This family line was passed down for a long time.

19:07.700 --> 19:11.150
The Zhang family had a culture
of getting tattoos on their bodies.

19:11.150 --> 19:13.040
The tattoo recorded on this piece of skin

19:13.040 --> 19:15.040
has a history of thousands of years.

19:16.230 --> 19:17.490
Thousands of years...

19:17.910 --> 19:20.110
Legend has it that over 1,000 years ago,

19:20.170 --> 19:22.720
the Zhang family established
the Southern Archives.

19:22.720 --> 19:25.790
to specifically investigate
strange events in the western region.

19:25.790 --> 19:28.150
Later, Archives were established
in various places.

19:28.150 --> 19:30.570
The Southern Archives
was established the latest,

19:30.570 --> 19:32.570
with a history of just over 80 years.

19:33.640 --> 19:36.560
The Zhang family sure sticks their noses
into a lot of things.

19:36.560 --> 19:39.220
They don't care
even about the Empress Dowager.

19:39.530 --> 19:41.930
Is there no farm work
to do in their village?

19:42.590 --> 19:44.030
But in actuality,

19:46.110 --> 19:48.140
the Archives were a medium of cooperation

19:48.140 --> 19:50.810
between the Zhang family
and the imperial court.

19:50.810 --> 19:52.550
The imperial court
allocated a lot of money

19:52.550 --> 19:54.750
for the Archives
to eliminate the bad and protect the good,

19:54.750 --> 19:56.850
and investigate mysterious incidents
across the land.

19:56.850 --> 19:58.440
After all the changes in the world,

19:58.440 --> 19:59.770
the Archives survived.

20:00.250 --> 20:02.000
By investigating these events,

20:02.000 --> 20:03.570
we can earn a lot of income.

20:03.940 --> 20:05.130
So the Archives

20:05.150 --> 20:06.650
became our livelihood.

20:08.110 --> 20:10.170
So that's how the Archives came to be.

20:10.840 --> 20:12.990
That Nanyang Maritime Supervisory Office

20:12.990 --> 20:14.190
and its secret branch,

20:14.190 --> 20:16.030
they weren't completely fooling me.

20:16.030 --> 20:17.420
When the Archives were first established,

20:17.420 --> 20:19.330
only the Zhang family members
were involved.

20:19.330 --> 20:20.990
But since the last century,

20:21.110 --> 20:23.050
the Zhang family's population
has decreased.

20:23.050 --> 20:25.120
So in the remote Nanyang region,

20:25.140 --> 20:26.900
we started recruiting orphans.

20:26.900 --> 20:28.360
Just like Shrimpie and me.

20:28.430 --> 20:28.910
Right.

20:30.400 --> 20:32.380
We made you all
change your surnames to Zhang

20:32.380 --> 20:35.180
and trained you
to become members of the Archives.

20:35.660 --> 20:36.480
This time,

20:37.890 --> 20:39.240
I will let you know

20:39.920 --> 20:41.650
what the Zhang family truly is.

20:42.320 --> 20:42.940
This way.

20:48.770 --> 20:49.650
Zhang Ruipu?

20:51.790 --> 20:53.110
Why is his body here?

20:53.770 --> 20:55.700
I brought him back from the Nan'an.

20:55.810 --> 20:57.410
I've placed him here for now.

20:57.420 --> 20:58.020
Take a look

20:58.660 --> 21:00.720
and see if there's anything special.

21:05.330 --> 21:06.790
His fingers are very long.

21:07.470 --> 21:08.850
I noticed this before.

21:09.380 --> 21:11.470
It's one of the characteristics
of the Zhang family.

21:11.470 --> 21:12.920
Through special training,

21:12.920 --> 21:15.440
their fingers become longer
than ordinary people's.

21:15.440 --> 21:16.290
These long fingers

21:16.290 --> 21:17.860
are used to decipher mechanisms.

21:17.860 --> 21:19.190
The longer the fingers,

21:19.200 --> 21:21.860
the better they can reach
into narrower spaces.

21:21.910 --> 21:23.040
Zhang Ruipu's file.

21:33.180 --> 21:34.460
This was taken
when the Minister of Commerce

21:34.460 --> 21:36.320
was negotiating with foreigners.

21:36.320 --> 21:38.370
[Southern Archives]
[Case closure report]

21:36.440 --> 21:38.440
Zhang Ruipu, Minister of Commerce.

21:41.010 --> 21:42.610
[Case closure report]

21:42.830 --> 21:44.210
Ninety years ago.

21:45.590 --> 21:47.050
He was in his 20s back then.

21:47.200 --> 21:48.220
Now he is over 100?

21:52.320 --> 21:54.120
I saw in other documents at the Archives

21:54.120 --> 21:55.980
that the Zhang family members...

21:56.360 --> 21:57.270
live quite long.

21:57.270 --> 21:59.200
But I didn't expect them
to live this long.

21:59.200 --> 22:01.530
They do live longer than ordinary people.

22:09.220 --> 22:11.510
Besides long fingers and longevity,

22:11.540 --> 22:13.960
the Zhang family members
also all have tattoos.

22:13.960 --> 22:15.030
The ink

22:15.050 --> 22:16.890
is made from special herbs and bird blood

22:16.890 --> 22:18.000
mixed together.

22:18.430 --> 22:20.560
They only appear when the blood is hot.

22:28.850 --> 22:31.190
This is a rubbing of his tattoo,

22:31.320 --> 22:32.920
used to verify his identity.

22:33.210 --> 22:35.750
Because everyone's tattoo is different.

22:36.460 --> 22:38.340
The herbs used for the tattoo

22:38.470 --> 22:39.650
are very rare

22:40.070 --> 22:41.470
and have unique effects.

22:41.670 --> 22:44.370
They can make
the Zhang family's skills and physique

22:44.370 --> 22:45.850
surpass those of ordinary people.

22:45.850 --> 22:47.130
They will die slower.

22:48.340 --> 22:50.270
At the same time, it makes our blood

22:50.460 --> 22:52.460
different from ordinary people's.

22:56.350 --> 22:58.650
Shrimpie and I are both adopted orphans,

22:59.800 --> 23:01.470
but he has a tattoo and I don't.

23:01.640 --> 23:04.440
Because you're not
a real Zhang family member yet.

23:07.370 --> 23:07.980
Let's go.

24:25.690 --> 24:26.610
Mentor,

24:26.900 --> 24:28.630
how did your wound heal so fast?

24:28.730 --> 24:31.590
Because the hot springs here
and Zhang family blood

24:31.680 --> 24:33.460
can help them heal quickly.

24:38.320 --> 24:39.390
You and Shrimpie

24:40.000 --> 24:41.730
are both from the Zhang family.

24:42.440 --> 24:43.460
Only I'm not.

24:48.770 --> 24:49.510
Come here.

24:53.320 --> 24:55.130
We have been apart for 10 years.

24:55.790 --> 24:57.790
After these 10 years of experience,

24:58.060 --> 24:59.590
It's time for you to grow up.

25:09.770 --> 25:12.000
Mentor, why am I feeling a bit dizzy?

25:13.270 --> 25:15.270
The hot spring here is very special.

25:15.480 --> 25:17.960
Ordinary people can't last long in it.

25:34.330 --> 25:35.480
Mentor...

25:36.260 --> 25:37.860
Then what are you going to do?

25:37.980 --> 25:39.870
You have planted your own cause.

25:40.270 --> 25:41.960
Now, the chance
I originally wanted to give you to leave

25:41.960 --> 25:42.700
is also gone.

25:44.070 --> 25:45.180
Then,

25:45.210 --> 25:47.620
you can only accept your own fate.

25:48.850 --> 25:49.980
From this day forth,

25:50.230 --> 25:52.380
you shall offer your body
to feed the blood.

25:52.380 --> 25:54.300
When the blood boils,
it shall be unleashed.

25:54.300 --> 25:56.650
Thus, you shall stand firm
in the Primordial World,

25:56.650 --> 25:58.580
and nothing shall be denied to you.

26:52.970 --> 26:54.050
Zhang Hailou.

26:54.370 --> 26:55.650
From now on,

26:56.500 --> 26:58.500
you are a member of the Zhang family.

27:08.770 --> 27:12.030
Is this what it feels like
to be a member of the Zhang family?

27:12.050 --> 27:13.330
This is so cool.

27:14.590 --> 27:17.120
I clearly felt like
I was going to die just now.

27:17.960 --> 27:20.250
But now I feel like I can do it again.

27:20.420 --> 27:22.420
Because the pigment I told you about

27:22.780 --> 27:25.150
is made from rare and expensive herbs

27:25.180 --> 27:26.470
mixed together.

27:27.250 --> 27:27.980
These herbs

27:27.980 --> 27:30.330
have excellent healing
and pain-relieving effects.

27:30.330 --> 27:31.530
So you'll feel like

27:31.530 --> 27:33.220
you're recovering very quickly.

27:33.220 --> 27:34.950
Furthermore, these medicines

27:35.070 --> 27:37.750
will improve your physical functions
to some extent.

27:37.750 --> 27:40.950
You'll gain strength
greater than an ordinary person's.

27:42.220 --> 27:42.890
Go.

28:45.960 --> 28:47.020
I got the medicine.

28:54.880 --> 28:57.010
But isn't the duration of being a Zhang

28:58.070 --> 28:59.960
a bit too short?

29:00.200 --> 29:01.530
It's not a miracle drug.

29:01.810 --> 29:03.640
Your body needs time to adapt.

29:06.030 --> 29:07.560
You take the medicine first

29:07.740 --> 29:08.460
and go save Shrimpie.

29:08.460 --> 29:09.860
I'll be right behind you.

29:11.090 --> 29:12.620
We've delayed for too long.

29:54.110 --> 29:55.970
This medicine wasn't easy to get.

29:56.120 --> 29:57.020
Zhang Haixia.

31:35.090 --> 31:36.590
Answer whatever I ask.

31:36.710 --> 31:37.370
Where am I?

31:37.610 --> 31:39.140
Th-This is

31:39.320 --> 31:40.720
the Dong family's villa.

31:41.310 --> 31:42.710
The Dong family's villa?

31:43.290 --> 31:44.080
Y-Yes.

31:44.250 --> 31:45.380
Who brought me here?

31:46.320 --> 31:47.570
M-Miss Dong.

31:48.470 --> 31:49.420
Miss Dong.

31:49.820 --> 31:50.610
Miss Dong?

31:50.900 --> 31:51.290
Yes.

31:51.650 --> 31:53.750
You shall offer your body
to feed the blood.

31:53.750 --> 31:55.460
When the blood boils,
it shall be unleashed.

31:55.460 --> 31:57.510
Thus, you shall stand firm
in the Primordial World,

31:57.510 --> 31:59.440
and nothing shall be denied to you.

31:59.640 --> 32:00.350
Mentor.

32:02.720 --> 32:03.630
Miss Dong said

32:03.760 --> 32:04.800
you were injured,

32:05.020 --> 32:07.020
and asked us to take good care of you.

32:10.250 --> 32:12.310
Did she bring back another man?

32:12.890 --> 32:14.800
Yes, there is another man.

32:14.980 --> 32:15.830
He is already awake.

32:15.830 --> 32:16.660
Where is he?

32:16.890 --> 32:18.980
Miss Dong is taking care of him herself.

32:18.980 --> 32:20.040
Where is Miss Dong?

32:20.940 --> 32:23.430
I-In the courtyard.

33:14.140 --> 33:16.090
That old roof beam was just repaired.

33:16.090 --> 33:16.850
If you break it,

33:16.850 --> 33:18.310
I'll use you to patch it up.

33:20.100 --> 33:21.280
Your disciple hasn't recovered yet,

33:21.280 --> 33:22.720
and you don't even care.

33:22.880 --> 33:23.720
At your age,

33:23.720 --> 33:25.770
can't you learn how to care for others?

33:25.770 --> 33:27.290
You didn't die, did you?

33:27.540 --> 33:28.690
How are you feeling?

33:35.400 --> 33:37.900
It feels great
to be a member of the Zhang family.

33:37.900 --> 33:38.870
I just feel

33:39.220 --> 33:40.690
like I missed out a lot
over the past decade.

33:40.690 --> 33:43.220
Don't get ahead of yourself.
You almost died.

33:43.500 --> 33:44.460
Go lie back down.

33:45.220 --> 33:46.310
Why would I?

33:48.010 --> 33:49.070
Where is Shrimpie?

33:51.340 --> 33:52.900
He's saved.

33:53.230 --> 33:55.290
He woke up a few days earlier than you.

33:55.580 --> 33:57.220
You never do anything right,

33:57.750 --> 34:00.350
but you finally
did something right this time.

34:01.340 --> 34:02.120
Where is he?

34:02.850 --> 34:03.830
At this hour,

34:04.010 --> 34:05.670
it should be the same as usual.

34:10.600 --> 34:11.900
Brat.

34:12.000 --> 34:13.500
He hasn't changed his bad habits at all.
